                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "\\begin{aligned}P(R,G,R)&=\\frac{12}{22}\\times\\frac{10}{22}\\times\\frac{12}{22}\\\\P(R,G,R)&=\\frac{1440}{10648}\\\\P(R,G,R)&=\\frac{180}{1331}\\end{aligned}",
